    "detailed_description": "<strong>Story</strong><br>This is a story about a little girl who is grieving the loss of her best friend.<br>It's been a long time since then, but no one believes her when she says she lost her friend because a monster ate him.<br>But that doesn't make sense: She never tells lies. She always gets golden stars from her teacher. In short, she's a good girl.<br>Or is she? After all, she also has the power of the &quot;malice&quot;.<br><br>Could you listen to her story, and maybe help her out?<br><br><strong>Gameplay &amp; Features</strong><br>This is a visual novel where you can:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Read a short story where you can make choices that changes the outcome.<br></li><li>Get up to 5 different endings. Each one gives a new perspective of the story.<br></li><li>Collect up to 27 special CG events.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Story</strong><br>This is a story about a little girl who is grieving the loss of her best friend.<br>It's been a long time since then, but no one believes her when she says she lost her friend because a monster ate him.<br>But that doesn't make sense: She never tells lies. She always gets golden stars from her teacher. In short, she's a good girl.<br>Or is she? After all, she also has the power of the &quot;malice&quot;.<br><br>Could you listen to her story, and maybe help her out?<br><br><strong>Gameplay &amp; Features</strong><br>This is a visual novel where you can:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Read a short story where you can make choices that changes the outcome.<br></li><li>Get up to 5 different endings. Each one gives a new perspective of the story.<br></li><li>Collect up to 27 special CG events.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Amanita is feeling down lately. She lost her best friend and she can't do anything about it. Could you listen to her story, and maybe help her out?",
